---
title: Contact
description: Write to the GGE Command team about your account, a bot or a bug. Check Troubleshooting and the FAQ first, because many answers are there.
---

Stuck, or found something broken? Send us a message. Most questions already have an answer, so give these two pages a quick look first: [Troubleshooting](/troubleshooting/) and the [FAQ](/faq/).

## What to include {% #include %}

A short, clear message gets a faster answer. Tell us:

- Your {% term id="game-account" %}game account{% /term %} name and the {% term id="server" %}server{% /term %} it plays on.
- What you expected to happen.
- What happened instead, and any message the app showed.
- The time it happened, with your time zone.

{% aside type="danger" id="never-password" %}
Never send your game password, or the password for your {% term id="gge-command-account" %}GGE Command account{% /term %}. We never need it.
{% /aside %}

